# All four parts render inside the columns. The silent failure this guards
# against is {cols} used without an inner {parts}, which drops every item and
# still produces a clean PDF -- so asserting the part text is the only way to
# tell a working two-column layout from an empty one.
COLSSTEMMARK
COLSPARTAMARK
COLSPARTBMARK
COLSPARTCMARK
COLSPARTDMARK
